STATUS
Exact finite-local replay for Lemma 5A8H28AM.  The lemma is an
unbounded proof of Target 5A8H28R12: the replay checks only the fixed
five-step cone identity, its finitely many affine-wall truncations,
and the exact K=4 recurrence/formula used in that proof.  It is not a
bounded scan used to infer the theorem.

